{"path":"utility/basic_stacktrace/at","title":"std::basic_stacktrace<Allocator>::at","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_stacktrace&lt;Allocator&gt;::</span>at","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/basic_stacktrace/at","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Returns a reference to the entry at specified location pos, with bounds checking.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">const_reference at<span class=\"br0\">(</span> size_type pos <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns a reference to the entry at specified location <code>pos</code>, with bounds checking. \n</p><p>If <code>pos</code> is not within the range of the stacktrace, an exception of type <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/out_of_range\">std::out_of_range</a></span> is thrown.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  pos\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  position of the stacktrace entry to return\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Reference to the requested entry.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p><span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/out_of_range\">std::out_of_range</a></span> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pos <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;=</span> size<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/basic_stacktrace/operator_at\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator[]</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  access specified stacktrace entry <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/basic_stacktrace","title":"std::basic_stacktrace"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_stacktrace<Allocator>::at","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Returns a reference to the entry at specified location pos, with bounds checking."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"pos"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Reference to the requested entry."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"std::out_of_range if pos >= size()."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"operator[]","note":"access specified stacktrace entry"}]}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":80,"codeBlockCount":0}
